 "transcript": "When I used to live here, I knew a guy up here with a penthouse worth $1.5 million and he was struggling. He was struggling mentally to get his businesses and his other ventures off the ground. And he was sitting in that penthouse just trying to figure it out. So what he did is he moved out of state, cut out the distractions. He optimized his credit and then he put it to work alongside investors and credit partners. And within six months, his income was over $400,000 a month. The one thing he figured out is how to leverage your credit correctly. And I know plenty of up, I know, and I know plenty of people up here who run companies and scale businesses and the ones who do it most efficiently. Use other people's money. Give me a lever long enough and I can move the world. Credit is that lever and the building and building with only your own cash is the slowest way to build wealth there is. And it's the slowest way to build wealth there is. Click the link below. Click the link below wherever your credit is right now. We'll walk you through how to optimize it and how to get your own funding. And if you want us to help you along the way, we'll do that too. Cheers.",
